{"650440":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Warbanners","steam_appid":650440,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[818700],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/extras\/0487a2e7f5252dedaebb561d5db4e7eb.avif?t=1760518777\" width=600 height=346 \/><\/span><br><br>Warbanners is a turn-based, tactical strategy game with role-playing elements. Managing a squad of mercenaries, the player will experience the story campaign's 42 missions, battle through a meticulously crafted fantasy world, and achieve the ultimate goal: become a true legend! <br><br>Key features:<br>• Create and modify your unique, well-prepared army; hire and equip soldiers, develop their fighting qualities, and learn new exotic skills.<br>• Hire assistants! They will not participate in battles themselves, they never engage in dangerous activities, but they will provide you with several bonuses and options. Expect a catapult, poisoned enemies, increased morale, and much, much more.<br>• Immerse yourself in a multi-faceted battle system that takes into account a variety of factors, including landscape morphology and lighting, each unit's field of view, morale, and even fatigue.<br>• Manipulate the battlefield environment to gain tactical advantages! Freeze rivers, chop down and burn trees, dig trenches, construct bridges and barricades, and so on.<br>• Choose the optimal level of difficulty for your tactical fantasy RPG experience; from easy for beginners, to nightmarish for sophisticated tacticians.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/extras\/4e7d08220e421c88fe5ebbd0ba6df0e8.poster.avif?t=1760518777\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/extras\/4e7d08220e421c88fe5ebbd0ba6df0e8.mp4?t=1760518777\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>With every step you take in Warbanners --each and everyone marked by blood and iron-- an invisible but deadly threat will become more tangible. Darkness itself, brooding in the corners of your soul, shall become ever more palpable.<br>Who said earning your place among ancient legends would be easy?","about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/extras\/0487a2e7f5252dedaebb561d5db4e7eb.avif?t=1760518777\" width=600 height=346 \/><\/span><br><br>Warbanners is a turn-based, tactical strategy game with role-playing elements. Managing a squad of mercenaries, the player will experience the story campaign's 42 missions, battle through a meticulously crafted fantasy world, and achieve the ultimate goal: become a true legend! <br><br>Key features:<br>• Create and modify your unique, well-prepared army; hire and equip soldiers, develop their fighting qualities, and learn new exotic skills.<br>• Hire assistants! They will not participate in battles themselves, they never engage in dangerous activities, but they will provide you with several bonuses and options. Expect a catapult, poisoned enemies, increased morale, and much, much more.<br>• Immerse yourself in a multi-faceted battle system that takes into account a variety of factors, including landscape morphology and lighting, each unit's field of view, morale, and even fatigue.<br>• Manipulate the battlefield environment to gain tactical advantages! Freeze rivers, chop down and burn trees, dig trenches, construct bridges and barricades, and so on.<br>• Choose the optimal level of difficulty for your tactical fantasy RPG experience; from easy for beginners, to nightmarish for sophisticated tacticians.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/extras\/4e7d08220e421c88fe5ebbd0ba6df0e8.poster.avif?t=1760518777\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/extras\/4e7d08220e421c88fe5ebbd0ba6df0e8.mp4?t=1760518777\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>With every step you take in Warbanners --each and everyone marked by blood and iron-- an invisible but deadly threat will become more tangible. Darkness itself, brooding in the corners of your soul, shall become ever more palpable.<br>Who said earning your place among ancient legends would be easy?","short_description":"Warbanners: the turn-based, tactical strategy game with role-playing elements that lets you manage a squad of mercenaries, and survive 42 campaign missions. Your goal? To earn a place among ancient legends!","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong>, 러시아어, 우크라이나어, 독일어, 포르투갈어 - 포르투갈, 폴란드어, 중국어 간체, 튀르키예어, 스페인어 - 스페인, 프랑스어<br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","reviews":"“Warbanners is challenging, tough, and occasionally frustrating. But each victory is as satisfying as it is hard-earned, and well worth the struggle.”<br>8 – Bonus Stage<br><br>“Warbanners is tough — but in a great way!”<br>Big Boss Battle<br><br>“Definitely worth a try.”<br>8 – RPG Italia<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/header.jpg?t=1760518777","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760518777","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/650440\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760518777","website":"https:\/\/warbannersgame.wordpress.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows XP or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> 2GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 512 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><s